OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSADriver jailed after police pursuit
OL,4,Ain which man died
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe driver, Adrian Osiecki, carried out
OL,7,Fa number of dangerous manoeuvres before
OL,8,Fthe caravan unclipped from the vehicle,
OL,9,Fwhich sped off before going into
OL,10,Fstanding water and crashing into a wall
OL,11,Fon a bridge in Main Street, Egginton.
OL,13,FA Polish national, a passenger in the
OL,14,FBMW, also fled the scene and entered a
OL,15,Fflooded brook, but was pronounced dead
OL,16,Fafter being pulled out of the water.
